    "text": "Let the images of the point <math><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> about the lines <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math> and <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi></math> are <math><mi>P</mi></math> and <math><mi>Q</mi></math> respectively. If the line <math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> passes through the origin, then <math><mi>m</mi></math> is equal to",
